/-!
# Data of the `μ > 0` passing guiding-centre torus family certificate (high resolution, part 4)

Stored Chebyshev coefficients (`SliceData`, `Certificates/KronChebCompute`) of the centres of the
high-resolution family ball pipeline (`Design/RationalStellaratorGCEw4EnvH`): layout `N = 36`, `M = 27`,
Chebyshev degree `D = 12`, scale `2^{−107}`. Generated by the untrusted oracle
`scripts/gc_kam/lam_cert.py`, `lam_emit_lean.py`; nothing here is trusted.

Energy-window node 4: gyro-length `ρ_4 = 1/256 + 2⁻³²`, its own family torus `K_4(λ)`; the
fields at `ρ_4` are the nodes `DtJ`, `nRtJ`, `nZtJ`.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC

open PlasmaLean.Certificates.KronBallCheb

